text = "[b][u]The Files: How Important are they ?[/u][/b]"

[node name="Label1" type="Label" parent="Left/Nodes" parent_id_path=PackedInt32Array(1644936578) index="2" unique_id=435658224]
custom_minimum_size = Vector2(1, 0)
layout_mode = 2
theme_override_font_sizes/font_size = 15
text = "At your job, you have two best friends: Your handbook (I think you know why), and the files .

Unfortunatly, as the safe asked us very kindly, your handbook does not contains all the knowledge needed to get the secret code .
In his head, he though the secret code was too easy to crack maybe (but if you think this is stupid/useless, I'm on your side) .

How the files work ?
It's easy, they are installed on your device in two ways:
- The \"no consent respect Microslop like behavoir\", where the files are downloaded without your consent on your device, at a choosen location . And try to open your file explorer at the location of the downloaded file
- The good behavoir, where the safe ask you if you want to download the file, and where you want . You will have to look for them, all by yourself to read the content . You are highly encouraged to download them, they can contain informations required to help you find the secret code"
horizontal_alignment = 1
autowrap_mode = 3

[node name="Label1" type="Label" parent="Right/Nodes" parent_id_path=PackedInt32Array(1257509253) index="2" unique_id=229044363]
